# 🛡️ V Tracker Admin Panel — API Integration Mapping Guide

> **Server Base URL:** `http://localhost:5000`  
> **Auth Header:** `Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>`  
> **Content-Type:** `application/json`

Ye document specify karta hai ki backend ki kaunsi API Admin Panel ke kis page par integrate karni hai aur kyun chahiye.

---

## 🔐 1. Authentication & System Core APIs

### 1. Admin Login API
- **Target Page:** Login Page ([`src/pages/Login.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/Login.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `POST /v1/auth/login`
- **Why We Need It There:** Admin credentials (`email`, `password`, `deviceId`) verify karta hai, check karta hai ki user role `ADMIN` hai ya nahi, aur JWT `accessToken` & `refreshToken` return karta hai jisse poore dashboard ko access milta hai. *(Status: ✅ Already Integrated)*

### 2. Admin Logout API
- **Target Page:** Global Header & Sidebar ([`src/components/layout/Header.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/components/layout/Header.jsx), [`src/components/layout/Sidebar.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/components/layout/Sidebar.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `POST /v1/auth/logout`
- **Why We Need It There:** Jab admin Logout button click kare, server-side refresh token blacklist/revoke ho jaye aur browser storage se admin session securely clear karke `/` (Login) par redirect kiya ja sake. *(Status: ✅ Already Integrated in Sidebar.jsx)*

### 3. Token Refresh API
- **Target Page:** App Root / Background Session Handler ([`src/App.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/App.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `POST /v1/auth/refresh`
- **Why We Need It There:** 15-minute ka short-lived JWT access token expire hone par background mein auto-refresh ho sake, taaki admin bar-bar logout na ho aur uninterrupted dashboard use kar sake.

### 4. Admin Profile API
- **Target Page:** Admin Profile Page ([`src/pages/AdminProfile.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/AdminProfile.jsx)) & Navbar Header ([`src/components/layout/Header.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/components/layout/Header.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `GET /v1/me`
- **Why We Need It There:** Top navbar profile avatar aur initials render karne ke liye, aur right corner "V Tracker Admin" click karne par poori details (Member ID, Role, Phone, Address, KYC Status, Points) dedicated Profile screen par display karne ke liye. *(Status: ✅ Already Integrated)*

### 5. All Users List API
- **Target Page:** User Management Page ([`src/pages/Users.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/Users.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `GET /v1/admin/users`
- **Why We Need It There:** Registered users ki complete list, summary statistics (total, active, disabled), search & filters, pagination load karne ke liye. *(Status: ✅ Already Integrated)*

### 6. Particular User Details API
- **Target Page:** User Details Drawer ([`src/components/users/UserDrawer.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/components/users/UserDrawer.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `GET /v1/admin/users/:id` (ADM-05)
- **Why We Need It There:** Kisi selected user ka full profile inspect karne ke liye (address, KYC status, wallet balance, linked vehicles, recent hardware orders, referral statistics). *(Status: ✅ Already Integrated)*

### 7. Update User Profile API
- **Target Page:** User Details Drawer Edit View ([`src/components/users/UserDrawer.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/components/users/UserDrawer.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `PATCH /v1/admin/users/:id` (ADM-06)
- **Why We Need It There:** User support ticket aane par user ki basic information (Name, Email, Address, City, State, Pincode) admin se directly edit karne ke liye. *(Status: ✅ Already Integrated)*

### 8. Change User Status (Block / Activate) API
- **Target Page:** User Details Drawer & Block Modal ([`src/components/users/UserDrawer.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/components/users/UserDrawer.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `PATCH /v1/admin/users/:id/status` (ADM-07)
- **Why We Need It There:** Fraudulent activity ya abusive calls hone par user ko `DISABLED` karke instant all sessions revoke karne ya wapas `ACTIVE` karne ke liye. *(Status: ✅ Already Integrated)*

### 9. Force Logout User Sessions API
- **Target Page:** User Details Drawer ([`src/components/users/UserDrawer.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/components/users/UserDrawer.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `POST /v1/admin/users/:id/logout` (ADM-09)
- **Why We Need It There:** Lost phone ya security risk hone par user ke sabhi active JWT refresh tokens ko turant revoke karne ke liye. *(Status: ✅ Already Integrated)*

### 10. Change User Role API
- **Target Page:** User Details Drawer Edit View ([`src/components/users/UserDrawer.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/components/users/UserDrawer.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `PATCH /v1/admin/users/:id/role` (ADM-08)
- **Why We Need It There:** Kisi user ko `ADMIN` ya standard `OWNER` role assign/revoke karne ke liye. *(Status: ✅ Already Integrated)*

### 11. System Health Ping API
- **Target Page:** Dashboard Overview ([`src/pages/Dashboard.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/Dashboard.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `GET /health`
- **Why We Need It There:** Server aur MongoDB cluster ka live uptime status (`{"status":"ok","db":"up"}`) dashboard header ya status badge par show karne ke liye, jisse pata chale backend online hai.

### 6. Global App Config API
- **Target Page:** Dashboard & Settings ([`src/pages/Dashboard.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/Dashboard.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `GET /v1/config`
- **Why We Need It There:** System-wide settings (maintenance mode status, min mobile app version, active feature toggles) monitor karne ke liye.

