## 📋 2. Verification & KYC Review Workflows (System-Wide)

### 7. All Users Document Review Queue API
- **Target Page:** Vehicle Documents Page ([`src/pages/VehicleDocuments.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/VehicleDocuments.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `GET /v1/admin/documents?status=PENDING_VERIFICATION`
- **Why We Need It There:** Sabhi app users dwara upload kiye gaye vehicle documents (RC, Insurance, PUC, Driving Licence) ki live queue load karne ke liye taaki admin verification start kar sake.

### 8. Approve / Reject User Document API
- **Target Page:** Vehicle Documents Review Modal ([`src/pages/VehicleDocuments.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/VehicleDocuments.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `PATCH /v1/admin/documents/:id`
- **Why We Need It There:** Document inspect karne ke baad admin decision (`APPROVE` ya `REJECT` with reason) submit karne ke liye. Backend automatic user ko push notification bhejta hai.

### 9. Decrypt & View Document File API
- **Target Page:** Document Preview Modal ([`src/pages/VehicleDocuments.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/VehicleDocuments.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `GET /v1/files/:token`
- **Why We Need It There:** User ke uploaded sensitive encrypted files (AES-256-GCM) ko stream karke admin browser mein high-res image/PDF preview dikhane ke liye.

