## 💰 3. Payouts & Finance Workflows

### 10. Referral Payout Settlement Action API
- **Target Page:** Referral Payouts Page ([`src/pages/ReferralPayouts.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/ReferralPayouts.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `PATCH /v1/admin/payouts/:id`
- **Why We Need It There:** Admin manual referral commission payouts ko `CREDIT` (user ke wallet mein credit) ya `REVERSE` karne ke liye action buttons par trigger karega.

### 11. Bank IFSC Lookup API
- **Target Page:** Withdraw / Payout Details Modal ([`src/pages/Withdraw.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/Withdraw.jsx), [`src/pages/ReferralPayouts.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/ReferralPayouts.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `GET /v1/lookup/ifsc/:code`
- **Why We Need It There:** Payout approve karne se pehle user ke diye IFSC code se Bank Name aur Branch verify karne ke liye taaki wrong account mein paise na transfer hon.

