## 📦 4. Products, Packages & Inventory Workflows

### 12. Products / QR Packages Catalogue API
- **Target Page:** Plans & Pricing Page ([`src/pages/Plans.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/Plans.jsx)) & QR Inventory Recent Batches ([`src/pages/QRInventory.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/QRInventory.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `GET /v1/products`
- **Why We Need It There:** 
  1. **Plans Page:** QR packages (2 Wheeler, 4 Wheeler, Commercial), unki live pricing (paise to INR), GST rate, aur descriptions display karne ke liye.
  2. **QR Inventory Page:** Recent batches table mein category-wise current stock, pricing, aur stock availability show karne ke liye.

### 13. Single Product Detail API
- **Target Page:** Product Edit Modal ([`src/pages/Plans.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/Plans.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `GET /v1/products/:id`
- **Why We Need It There:** Kisi specific QR package ki complete details, rating, price, aur specs fetch karke view/edit modal mein display karne ke liye.

### 14. Inspect Any QR Code Status API
- **Target Page:** QR Inventory / Verification Modal ([`src/pages/QRInventory.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/QRInventory.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `GET /v1/qr/:qrUuid/status`
- **Why We Need It There:** Admin kisi bhi physical QR sticker ka UUID scan/enter karke instantly check kar sake ki ye `UNACTIVATED`, `ACTIVATED`, ya `INVALID` hai.

