## 🚗 5. Vehicles & Call Alerts Management

### 15. Vehicles List API
- **Target Page:** Vehicles Page ([`src/pages/Vehicles.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/Vehicles.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `GET /v1/vehicles`
- **Why We Need It There:** System mein registered vehicles, registration numbers, linked QR labels, aur vehicle types ka table render karne ke liye.

### 16. Force Unlink QR from Vehicle API
- **Target Page:** Vehicles Actions / QR Unlink Modal ([`src/pages/Vehicles.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/Vehicles.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `DELETE /v1/vehicles/:id/qr`
- **Why We Need It There:** Agar user ka QR tag damage ho gaya ya car sell ho gayi, toh admin vehicle se QR unbind karke nayi QR ke liye slot free kar sake.

### 17. Masked Call Logs API
- **Target Page:** Call Logs Page ([`src/pages/CallLogs.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/CallLogs.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `GET /v1/calls`
- **Why We Need It There:** QR scan karke bystander aur vehicle owner ke beech hui virtual masked phone calls, timestamps, duration, aur alert events ko audit karne ke liye.

### 18. Block Harassing Caller API
- **Target Page:** Call Logs Actions ([`src/pages/CallLogs.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/CallLogs.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `POST /v1/calls/:id/block`
- **Why We Need It There:** Agar koi caller spam ya harassment kar raha ho, toh admin use system-wide blacklist/block kar sake.

