## 🏷️ 6. Marketing, Orders & Support Workflows

### 19. All Customer Orders API
- **Target Page:** Orders Management Page ([`src/pages/Orders.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/Orders.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `GET /v1/admin/orders` (ADM-12)
- **Why We Need It There:** QR sticker orders ki live list, summary counts by status, customer details, delivery addresses, aur pricing load karne ke liye. *(Status: ✅ Already Integrated)*

### 20. Update Order Status / Dispatch Order API
- **Target Page:** Orders Management ([`src/pages/Orders.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/Orders.jsx)) & Dispatch Drawer ([`src/components/orders/OrderDispatchDrawer.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/components/orders/OrderDispatchDrawer.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `PATCH /v1/admin/orders/:id/status` (ADM-14)
- **Why We Need It There:** Order status directly dropdown se change karne ya dispatch drawer se courier AWB, tracking number aur hardware serial number assign karke `SHIPPED` mark karne ke liye. *(Status: ✅ Already Integrated)*

### 21. Order Detail & Invoice API
- **Target Page:** Order Invoice Page ([`src/pages/OrderInvoicePage.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/OrderInvoicePage.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `GET /v1/admin/orders/:id` (ADM-13)
- **Why We Need It There:** Specific order ke line items, delivery address, GST calculation, QR label codes, aur customer details load karke printable invoice generate karne ke liye. *(Status: ✅ Already Integrated)*

### 21. Validate & Manage Coupons API
- **Target Page:** Promotions Page ([`src/pages/Promotions.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/Promotions.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `POST /v1/coupons/validate`
- **Why We Need It There:** Admin panel par coupon codes ki validity, discount limits, aur expiry verify karne ke liye.

### 22. Support Tickets API
- **Target Page:** Support Management Page ([`src/pages/Support.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/Support.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `POST /v1/support/tickets` & `GET /v1/support/faqs`
- **Why We Need It There:** Customer support issues aur FAQs manage karne ke liye.

### 23. CMS Content Management API
- **Target Page:** CMS Page ([`src/pages/CMS.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/CMS.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `GET /v1/content/:slug`
- **Why We Need It There:** Legal pages jaise `/terms`, `/privacy`, aur `/about` ke static HTML/Markdown content blocks ko preview aur load karne ke liye.

### 24. Pincode to City/State Lookup API
- **Target Page:** Orders Dispatch & Address Forms ([`src/pages/Orders.jsx`](file:///f:/v-tracker-admin/src/pages/Orders.jsx))
- **API Endpoint:** `GET /v1/lookup/pincode/:pin`
- **Why We Need It There:** Shipping address verification ke time Indian 6-digit pincode se City aur State auto-fill karne ke liye.

